{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/3199","id":3540946176,"node_id":"PR_kwDOEFLz887TDo0A","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3199","diff_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3199.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3199.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/3199","number":3199,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"state: preserve nil expiry on user owned registration when no default is configured","user":{"login":"akhilesharora","id":484069,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4NDA2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/484069?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akhilesharora","html_url":"https://github.com/akhilesharora","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akhilesharora/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akhilesharora/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akhilesharora/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akhilesharora/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akhilesharora/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akhilesharora/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akhilesharora/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akhilesharora/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akhilesharora/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"<!-- Please tick if the following things apply. You… -->\n\n- [x] have read the [CONTRIBUTING.md](./CONTRIBUTING.md) file\n- [x] raised a GitHub issue or discussed it on the projects chat beforehand\n- [x] added unit tests\n- [ ] added integration tests\n- [ ] updated documentation if needed\n- [x] updated CHANGELOG.md\n\nWhen a user owned node registers or re registers with a PreAuthKey and the client sends zero expiry while `node.expiry` is set to `0`, the node's `expiry` column ends up as `0001-01-01 00:00:00` instead of NULL. `hscontrol/state/state.go` builds a pointer to `regReq.Expiry` unconditionally at two sites, even when the value is zero time. Downstream consumers that distinguish \"no expiry\" from \"expired at year 1\" (the headplane \"no expiry\" badge checks `=== null`) see the wrong state.\n\nThis change converts an unset `regReq.Expiry` to nil before handing it off, so the `needsDefaultExpiry` guard at `state.go:1644` is the only place that assigns a non nil pointer.\n\nAdded a regression test `TestReregistrationZeroExpiryStaysNil` that covers both initial and re registration paths with `node.expiry=0` and zero client expiry. It fails on master and passes with this change. Full `go test ./hscontrol/...` passes.\n\nThis is a narrower sibling of #3170 (tagged node on tailscaled restart) on the user owned PreAuthKey path. The regression was introduced alongside the fix for #3111 in commit 6337a3db.\n\nFixes #3198\n","created_at":"2026-04-16T17:47:20Z","updated_at":"2026-04-29T14:50:57Z","closed_at":"2026-04-29T12:06:39Z","merged_at":"2026-04-29T12:06:39Z","merge_commit_sha":"de60982d83f93b9ae8d44bdf9be80b19c3c3adf3","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"kradalby","id":98431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby","html_url":"https://github.com/kradalby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/events